answer	Pass the sequence as the 4th template argument: `flat_map<K, T, std::less<K>, small_vector<std::pair<K,T>, N>>` (or static_vector<…, N>). small_vector: past N it allocates on the heap and keeps working. static_vector: never allocates; past N it throws boost::container::bad_alloc (default throw_on_overflow<true>; UB if overflow checking is turned off).
